   "title": "sand-ripple",
   "tagline": "**中文视频（Fish Audio 哈基米）：** [sand-ripple-zh-fish.mp4](./video/sand-ripple-zh-fish.mp4) · [字幕文件](./video/sand-ripple-zh-fish.srt)",
   "builtBy": "GLM-5.2",
