   "tagline": "A **root beer float physics toy** for National Root Beer Float Day (August 6). Pour root beer, drop a scoop of vanilla, and watch CO₂ nucleation build the foam crown, displacement raise the surface, and overflow spill onto the counter. Built a day early — the actual holiday is tomorrow.",
